Error [jet.FreezeNotSnapshotable]: `freeze` cannot snapshot `Shared<Int>`: the value contains `Shared`, whose lock-backed handle would keep shared mutation
  --> tests/ui/freeze_shared_source.jet:3:12
    |
  3 |     freeze(handle)
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: A frozen value must be an owned cloneable value with no shared handle, resource, function, trait value, or mutable view inside it.
 Fix: Give the owned value to the task with `task &&name`, use `Shared`/`Cell` for deliberate shared state, or rebuild a plain owned value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1114
